きっと キミじゃなきゃ やだよ / オレは イケナイ太陽
I know it's gotta be you / I'm a naughty sun

475
00:36:41,056 --> 00:36:53,056
(Na Na Na Na Na Na Na Na...)

476
00:37:00,056 --> 00:37:06,056
「赤い糸」なんて 絵空事 / でも下心でさえ 信じたいの
The "red thread" is just a fantasy / But even with my ulterior motives, I want to believe

477
00:37:06,056 --> 00:37:12,856
俺は正しい キミも正しい / とにかくもう 左右されないぜ
I'm right, and you're right, too / Anyway, I won't be swayed anymore

478
00:37:12,856 --> 00:37:19,556
騙し騙され胸うずく / 下手な芝居が より盛り上げる夜
My heart aches as we deceive each other / This bad acting makes the night even more exciting

479
00:37:19,556 --> 00:37:25,556
息が耳に触れた二人 Ah
Our breath touching each other's ears, Ah

480
00:37:25,556 --> 00:37:33,056
ABC 続かない そんなんじゃダメじゃない / だって ココロの奥は 違うんじゃない?
ABC doesn't go any further, that's just no good / 'Cause what's inside our hearts is different, right?

481
00:37:33,056 --> 00:37:38,556
あたしの青春 そんなもんじゃない / 熱く奥で果てたいよ
My youth's better than that / I wanna climax deep inside that heat

482
00:37:38,556 --> 00:37:46,056
きっと キミじゃなきゃ やだよ / あたし イケナイ太陽
I know it's gotta be you / I'm a naughty sun

483
00:37:54,056 --> 00:38:09,056
(Hoo... Hoo... / Na Na Na...)

484
00:38:09,056 --> 00:38:23,056
交わす言葉の記憶遠く / 口元の動きに揺れ動く / 濡れた髪を撫でた そして Ah
Memories of the words we exchanged grow distant / The movement of your lips makes me tremble / I stroked your wet hair and then, Ah

485
00:38:23,056 --> 00:38:33,056
ABC ABC 続かない / そんなんじゃダメじゃない / だって ココロの奥は 違うんじゃない?
ABC ABC doesn't go any further / That's just no good / 'Cause what's inside our hearts is different, right?

486
00:38:33,056 --> 00:38:41,056
オレの青春 そんなもんじゃない / 熱く奥で果てたいよ / きっと キミじゃなきゃ やだよ
My youth's better than that / I wanna climax deep inside that heat / I know it's gotta be you

487
00:38:41,056 --> 00:38:48,056
オレは イケナイ太陽
I'm a naughty sun

488
00:38:48,056 --> 00:38:55,056
絡み合う糸は / 君と俺を結ぶ赤い糸
The intertwining thread / Is the red thread binding you and me

489
00:38:55,056 --> 00:39:09,056
(Na Na Na Na Na Na Na Na...)

490
00:39:17,556 --> 00:39:23,056
あー疲れたー！最高！
Ah, I'm tired! That was awesome!

491
00:39:23,556 --> 00:39:28,056
いやこの曲番長のセクシーがあふれ出てていいですね！
Man, Bancho's sexiness was really overflowing in this song, it was great!

492
00:39:28,056 --> 00:39:30,856
ちょっとアチアチになりましたね！
It got pretty hot in here!

493
00:39:30,856 --> 00:39:32,556
アチアチだねー！
Sure is hot!

494
00:39:32,856 --> 00:39:36,056
社長の動きも激熱でした！
Shacho's dance moves were super intense too!

495
00:39:36,256 --> 00:39:39,856
俺お前おど...歌なんだから！
I was supposed to be singing, you know!

496
00:39:40,056 --> 00:39:44,256
踊りかい！ってね！楽しかったー！
More like dancing! But yeah, that was so much fun!

497
00:39:44,556 --> 00:39:48,056
平成ですね、さっきから！
It's been so Heisei era since earlier!

498
00:39:48,256 --> 00:39:52,056
令和の曲わかんなくなってきたな...
I'm starting to not recognize Reiwa songs anymore...

499
00:39:57,056 --> 00:40:00,056
選曲も続きますよ！
The song selection continues!

500
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:02,164
かなでとらでんの出番なんじゃないの？
Isn't it Kanade and Raden's turn?

501
00:40:02,164 --> 00:40:03,464
え？いいじゃん
Eh? Sounds good!

502
00:40:03,464 --> 00:40:07,464
ちょっとこう結構ね ヒートアップしちゃったから 一旦クールダウンしようかね
It got pretty heated up, so let's cool down for a bit.

503
00:40:07,464 --> 00:40:09,164
よしっ！
Alright!

504
00:40:09,164 --> 00:40:11,864
らでんの体力も持ちませんから
Because Raden's stamina won't hold up either!

505
00:40:11,864 --> 00:40:13,964
ちょっとゆったりした曲をね
Let me do a slightly calm song.

506
00:40:13,964 --> 00:40:16,864
はい、じゃあ2人とも準備してくださいね
Okay, then both of you get ready.

507
00:40:16,864 --> 00:40:18,064
はーい
Okaay!

508
00:40:18,064 --> 00:40:20,164
はーい
Okaay!

509
00:40:20,164 --> 00:40:22,064
よっこいしょ
Up we go.

510
00:40:22,064 --> 00:40:24,064
準備いいですか？ はい！
Are you ready? Yes!

511
00:40:24,064 --> 00:40:26,564
はい！ あれ、座って歌う？
Yes! Wait, are you sitting down to sing?

512
00:40:26,564 --> 00:40:27,764
いや、立つ！
No, standing!

513
00:40:27,764 --> 00:40:28,864
あ、立ってるか！
Ah, you're standing!

514
00:40:28,864 --> 00:40:30,964
立ってるな！
Standing!

515
00:40:30,964 --> 00:40:32,464
心が踊ってきた！
My heart started dancing!

516
00:40:32,464 --> 00:40:35,064
では、音楽をお願いします！
Then, music please!

517
00:40:35,064 --> 00:40:36,664
踊っちゃダメよ
Don't dance!

518
00:41:00,864 --> 00:41:08,564
夕月夜 顔だす 消えてく子供の声
The evening moon shows its face, as children's voices fade away.

519
00:41:08,864 --> 00:41:21,264
遠く遠くこの空のどこかに 君はいるんだろう
Somewhere far, far away in this sky, you must be there.

520
00:41:21,264 --> 00:41:28,364
夏の終わりに 2人で抜け出した
Sneaking out together at the end of summer,

521
00:41:28,364 --> 00:41:39,864
この公園で見つけた あの星座 何だか覚えてる？
in this park we found that constellation... Do you remember what it was?

522
00:41:40,064 --> 00:41:48,364
会えなくても 記憶をたどって
Even if we can't meet, I trace my memories,

523
00:41:48,364 --> 00:41:56,564
同じ幸せを見たいんだ
wanting to see that same happiness.

524
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:00,064
あの香りとともに 花火がぱっと開く
Along with that scent, the fireworks burst open.

525
00:42:00,064 --> 00:42:08,564
行きたいよ 君のところへ 今すぐかけだして 行きたいよ
I want to go to where you are. I want to run to you right now.

526
00:42:08,564 --> 00:42:18,164
まっ暗で 何も見えない 怖くても大丈夫
It's pitch black and I can't see anything. I'm scared, but I'll be okay.

527
00:42:18,164 --> 00:42:28,064
数えきれない星空が 今もずっとここにあるんだよ
The sky with countless stars is still right here, always.

528
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:38,564
泣かないよ 昔君と見た きれいな空だったから
I won't cry, because the sky we saw together back then was so beautiful.

529
00:42:45,564 --> 00:42:52,564
あの道まで響く 靴の音が耳に残る
The sound of shoes echoing down that road remains in my ears.

530
00:42:52,564 --> 00:43:00,564
大きな自分の影を 見つめて想うのでしょう
Staring at my own large shadow, I wonder what you're thinking.

531
00:43:00,564 --> 00:43:09,564
ちっとも変わらないはずなのに せつない気持ちふくらんでく
Nothing should have changed at all, yet this painful feeling swells.

532
00:43:09,564 --> 00:43:20,564
どんなに想ったって 君はもういない
No matter how much I think of you, you're not here anymore.

533
00:43:20,564 --> 00:43:32,564
行きたいよ 君のそばに 小さくても小さくても
I want to go to your side, even if I'm small, even if I'm small.

534
00:43:32,564 --> 00:43:40,564
1番に君が好きだよ 強くいられる
You're the one I love the most, so I can stay strong.

535
00:43:40,564 --> 00:43:52,564
願いを流れ星に そっと唱えてみたけれど
I softly whispered a wish to a shooting star, but...

536
00:43:52,564 --> 00:44:02,064
泣かないよ 届くだろう きれいな空に
I won't cry, it will surely reach that beautiful sky.

537
00:44:15,564 --> 00:44:21,064
会えなくても 記憶をたどって
Even if we can't meet, I trace my memories,

538
00:44:21,064 --> 00:44:28,064
同じ幸せを見たいんだ
wanting to see that same happiness.

539
00:44:28,064 --> 00:44:38,064
あの香りとともに 花火がぱっと開く
Along with that scent, the fireworks burst open.

540
00:44:38,064 --> 00:44:44,564
行きたいよ 君のところへ
I want to go to where you are,

541
00:44:44,564 --> 00:44:48,564
小さな手をにぎりしめて
tightly holding your small hand.

542
00:44:48,564 --> 00:44:53,564
泣きたいよ それはそれは
I want to cry, it was, it was...

543
00:44:53,564 --> 00:45:00,064
きれいな空だった
such a beautiful sky.

544
00:45:00,072 --> 00:45:03,972
願いを 流れ星に
I quietly made a wish on a shooting star,

545
00:45:03,972 --> 00:45:08,072
そっと唱えて みたけれど
but even so...

546
00:45:08,072 --> 00:45:12,772
泣きたいよ 届かない
I want to cry; my feelings won't reach...

547
00:45:12,772 --> 00:45:18,572
想いを この空に…
my feelings to this sky...

548
00:45:41,072 --> 00:45:42,572
イェーイ！ ありがとう！
Yay! Thank you!

549
00:45:45,072 --> 00:45:48,072
すごい ハイタッチ！ ハイタッチまじ！
Wow, high five! High five, seriously!

550
00:45:48,272 --> 00:45:49,872
イェーイ！
Yay!

551
00:45:50,072 --> 00:45:51,572
ごめん！
Sorry!

552
00:45:52,072 --> 00:45:55,572
ちょっと形いい感じになった
That actually turned out pretty cool!

553
00:45:56,072 --> 00:45:58,072
はい プラネタリウムでした！
Alright, that was "Planetarium"!

554
00:45:58,272 --> 00:46:00,072
やったー！
Yay!

555
00:46:00,072 --> 00:46:02,372
もうこれライブパフォーマンスやん マジで！
That was straight up a live performance, seriously!

556
00:46:02,572 --> 00:46:04,872
最高すぎるやろ！
That was way too awesome!

557
00:46:05,172 --> 00:46:07,072
もう一回聞きたい！
I wanna hear it again!

558
00:46:07,872 --> 00:46:10,572
あの 体力がないですね
Well, I don't have the stamina for that.

559
00:46:10,872 --> 00:46:13,272
あ そっか 体力かー
Ah, right, stamina...

560
00:46:13,272 --> 00:46:15,572
えー じゃあ奏 歌う？ 一緒に
Eh, then Kanade, wanna sing? Together!

561
00:46:15,572 --> 00:46:17,572
えー！ 嫌だ！ 歌いたい！
Eh?! No way! I wanna sing!

562
00:46:17,572 --> 00:46:19,572
なんの… 何歌う？
What... What should we sing?

563
00:46:19,572 --> 00:46:21,872
もうあの曲行っちゃいますか！
Shall we just go with that song?!

564
00:46:21,872 --> 00:46:23,272
お！ 何々？
Ooh! What is it?

565
00:46:23,272 --> 00:46:28,072
やっぱお星様がキラキラしたら もう一回キラキラしていいんじゃないのー？
Since the stars shone so brightly, shouldn't we shine bright once more?

566
00:46:28,072 --> 00:46:30,872
プラネタリウムから外出ちゃう？
Heading outside from the planetarium?

567
00:46:30,872 --> 00:46:32,572
それー！
That's the one!

568
00:46:33,072 --> 00:46:35,072
何の曲かな〜？
What song could it be~?

569
00:46:35,072 --> 00:46:38,072
じゃあ行きましょう！ お願いしまーす！
Alright, let me cue it up! Here we go!

570
00:46:39,072 --> 00:46:43,072
どっちからだっけ？ え、どっちからだっけ？
Who starts first? Wait, who goes first?

571
00:47:05,572 --> 00:47:08,872
午前二時 フミキリに
At 2:00 a.m. at the railroad crossing,

572
00:47:08,872 --> 00:47:13,072
望遠鏡を 担いでった
I carried my telescope on my shoulder.

573
00:47:13,072 --> 00:47:16,872
ベルトに 結んだ ラジオ
With a radio tied to my belt,

574
00:47:16,872 --> 00:47:21,072
雨は 降らないらしい
it seemed it wouldn't rain.

575
00:47:21,072 --> 00:47:24,872
二分後に 君が来た
Two minutes later, you arrived,

576
00:47:24,872 --> 00:47:27,572
大袈裟な 荷物 しょってきた
carrying an exaggerated amount of luggage.

577
00:47:27,572 --> 00:47:30,872
始めようか 天体観測
Shall we begin our astronomical observation,

578
00:47:30,872 --> 00:47:33,272
ほうき星を 探して
searching for a shooting star?

579
00:47:33,272 --> 00:47:37,072
深い闇に 飲まれないように
We tried our hardest not to be swallowed

580
00:47:37,072 --> 00:47:39,872
精一杯だった
by the deep darkness.

581
00:47:40,072 --> 00:47:43,272
君の 震える 手を
On that day when I tried to hold

582
00:47:43,272 --> 00:47:45,272
握ろうとした あの日は
your trembling hand,

583
00:47:45,272 --> 00:47:48,272
見えないモノを 見ようとして
I peered through the telescope,

584
00:47:48,272 --> 00:47:50,872
望遠鏡を 覗き込んだ
trying to see the invisible.

585
00:47:50,872 --> 00:47:53,872
静寂を 切り裂いて
Tearing through the silence,

586
00:47:53,872 --> 00:47:56,272
いくつも 声が 生まれたよ
numerous voices were born.

587
00:47:56,272 --> 00:47:59,872
明日が 僕らを 呼んだって
Even if tomorrow called out to us,

588
00:47:59,872 --> 00:48:01,872
返事も ろくに しなかった
we barely bothered to reply.

589
00:48:01,872 --> 00:48:05,072
「イマ」という ほうき星
We were chasing the shooting star called "Now",

590
00:48:05,072 --> 00:48:08,872
君と 二人 追いかけていた
just the two of us.

591
00:48:08,872 --> 00:48:14,272
気が付けば いつだって ひたすら 何か 探している
Before I knew it, I'm always endlessly searching for something,

592
00:48:14,272 --> 00:48:17,572
幸せの 定義とか
like the definition of happiness

593
00:48:17,572 --> 00:48:22,572
哀しみの 置き場とか
or where sadness belongs.

594
00:48:22,572 --> 00:48:27,272
生まれたら 死ぬまで ずっと 探してる
From birth until death, I'll keep searching forever.

595
00:48:27,272 --> 00:48:30,872
さぁ 始めようか 天体観測
Come on, let's begin our astronomical observation,

596
00:48:30,872 --> 00:48:33,872
ほうき星を 探して
searching for a shooting star.

597
00:48:33,872 --> 00:48:38,072
今まで 見つけた モノは
I remember everything

598
00:48:38,072 --> 00:48:40,572
全部 覚えている
I've found up until now,

599
00:48:40,572 --> 00:48:43,272
君の 震える 手を
even the pain of not being able

600
00:48:43,272 --> 00:48:46,072
握れなかった 痛みも
to hold your trembling hand.

601
00:48:46,072 --> 00:48:49,072
知らないモノを 知ろうとして
I peered through the telescope,

602
00:48:49,072 --> 00:48:51,572
望遠鏡を 覗き込んだ
trying to know the unknown.

603
00:48:51,572 --> 00:48:54,872
暗闇を 照らす様 な
I searched for a faint light

604
00:48:54,872 --> 00:48:57,272
微かな 光 探したよ
that would illuminate the darkness.

605
00:48:57,272 --> 00:49:00,272
そうして 知った 痛みを
I still remember

606
00:49:00,272 --> 00:49:02,872
未だに 僕は 覚えている
the pain I came to know back then.

607
00:49:02,872 --> 00:49:06,072
「イマ」という ほうき星
I am still chasing the shooting star called "Now"

608
00:49:06,072 --> 00:49:10,572
今も 一人 追いかけている
all by myself.

609
00:49:10,572 --> 00:49:15,072
背が 伸びるにつれて
As I grew taller,

610
00:49:15,072 --> 00:49:18,572
伝えたい 事も 増えてった
the things I wanted to communicate increased as well.

611
00:49:18,572 --> 00:49:21,572
宛名の 無い 手紙も
Letters without addressees piled up

612
00:49:21,572 --> 00:49:24,272
崩れる程 重なった
until they were on the verge of collapsing.

613
00:49:24,272 --> 00:49:27,572
僕は 元気でいるよ
I am doing well,

614
00:49:27,572 --> 00:49:30,072
心配事も 少ないよ
and I don't have many worries.

615
00:49:30,072 --> 00:49:36,572
ただ ひとつ 今も 思い出すよ
There is just one thing I still remember:

616
00:49:36,572 --> 00:49:40,872
予報外れの 雨に 打たれて
That day when we were caught in an unexpected rain

617
00:49:40,872 --> 00:49:44,072
泣きだしそうな
and looked like we might start crying,

618
00:49:44,072 --> 00:49:46,872
君の 震える 手を
when I couldn't hold

619
00:49:46,872 --> 00:49:49,572
握れなかった あの日を
your trembling hand.

620
00:49:49,572 --> 00:49:52,572
見えてる モノを 見落として
Overlooking what was right in front of my eyes,

621
00:49:52,572 --> 00:49:55,072
望遠鏡を また 担いで
I hoisted my telescope once again,

622
00:49:55,072 --> 00:49:57,272
静寂と 暗闇の
and ran through the way home

623
00:49:57,272 --> 00:50:00,072
帰り道を 駆け抜けた
of silence and darkness.

624
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:04,280
そうして知った痛みが
And that pain I came to know

625
00:50:04,280 --> 00:50:07,380
未だに 僕を支えている
is still supporting me today.

626
00:50:07,380 --> 00:50:10,580
「イマ」というほうき星
"NOW" is a shooting star

627
00:50:10,580 --> 00:50:13,280
今も一人追いかけている
I'm still chasing alone.

628
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:16,880
もう一度君に会おうとして
Trying to meet you once again,

629
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:19,280
望遠鏡をまた担いで
I shoulder the telescope once more,

630
00:50:19,280 --> 00:50:22,580
前と同じ午前二時
at 2 a.m. just like before,

631
00:50:22,580 --> 00:50:24,880
フミキリまで駆けてくよ
and run to the railroad crossing.

632
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:28,080
始めようか 天体観測
Shall we begin stargazing?

633
00:50:28,080 --> 00:50:30,880
二分後に君が来なくとも
Even if you don't come in two minutes,

634
00:50:30,880 --> 00:50:33,880
「イマ」というほうき星
"NOW" is a shooting star

635
00:50:33,880 --> 00:50:37,080
君と二人追いかけている
that you and I are chasing together.

636
00:50:50,580 --> 00:50:53,080
なんか、すごく疲れた...
Man, I'm so exhausted...

637
00:50:53,880 --> 00:50:56,080
めっちゃ踊ってくれた...
You guys danced so much for us...

638
00:50:56,080 --> 00:50:58,280
踊ってたっていうかパフォーマンス？
Was that dancing, or more like a performance?

639
00:50:58,280 --> 00:51:00,280
体が勝手に...
My body just moved on its own...

640
00:51:00,280 --> 00:51:04,280
2人でね、呼吸を合わせに行ってたんだよね
The two of us were trying to get in sync, right?

641
00:51:04,280 --> 00:51:06,080
ああ疲れたね
Ah, I'm so tired.

642
00:51:06,080 --> 00:51:08,580
めっちゃ歩き回っちゃった
I ended up walking around so much.

643
00:51:08,580 --> 00:51:10,080
歩き回ってたね
You really were walking around!

644
00:51:10,080 --> 00:51:12,080
全員ちょっとヘトヘト...
Everyone is a bit worn out...

645
00:51:12,080 --> 00:51:16,580
1曲目からもうヘトヘトですけれども
Even though it's only the first song, we're already exhausted.

646
00:51:16,580 --> 00:51:21,280
でもね、このままちょっとらでんと番長の2人の歌も聴きたいなーなんて思ってるんですけれども
But still, I'd love to hear Raden and Bancho sing next!

647
00:51:21,280 --> 00:51:23,580
聴きたい！
We want to hear it!

648
00:51:23,580 --> 00:51:26,580
聴きたいじゃなくて、チャリで駆け上がりますか！
Instead of just listening, shall we race up on bikes?

649
00:51:26,580 --> 00:51:29,080
チャリで、行きますか！
On bikes? Let's go!

650
00:51:29,080 --> 00:51:31,080
行ってきてください！
Go for it!

651
00:51:31,080 --> 00:51:33,080
準備いいですか？
Are you ready?

652
00:51:33,080 --> 00:51:35,080
じゃあ、音楽お願いします！
Okay, music please!

653
00:51:38,080 --> 00:51:40,880
夏色！
Natsuiro!

654
00:51:40,880 --> 00:51:44,280
夏と言えば夏色や！
When you think of summer, it's Natsuiro!

655
00:51:44,880 --> 00:51:48,880
チャリンチャリンチャリンチャリン...
Ring-ding-ding-ding...

656
00:51:53,080 --> 00:51:57,880
駐車場のネコは アクビをしながら
The cat in the parking lot yawns

657
00:51:57,880 --> 00:52:00,880
今日も一日を過ごしてゆく
as it spends another day.

658
00:52:00,880 --> 00:52:05,580
何も変わらない 穏やかな街並
Nothing changes in this peaceful streetscape.

659
00:52:05,580 --> 00:52:09,080
みんな夏が来たって 浮かれ気分なのに
Everyone is excited that summer has come,

660
00:52:09,080 --> 00:52:14,280
君は一人さえな顔してるネ
yet you alone look downcast.

661
00:52:14,280 --> 00:52:19,080
そうだ君に 見せたい物があるんだ
That's right, there's something I want to show you:

662
00:52:19,080 --> 00:52:23,580
大きな五時半の夕やけ
A grand sunset at 5:30,

663
00:52:23,580 --> 00:52:27,580
子供の頃と同じように
just like when we were kids.

664
00:52:27,580 --> 00:52:34,080
海も空も雲も 僕等でさえも 染めてゆくから...
It dyes the sea, sky, clouds, and even us...

665
00:52:34,080 --> 00:52:40,080
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Carrying you on the back of my bicycle down this long, long downhill slope,

666
00:52:40,080 --> 00:52:43,080
ブレーキいっぱい 握りしめて
squeezing the brakes as tight as I can,

667
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:50,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
we slowly, slowly go down.

668
00:52:54,080 --> 00:52:58,080
下って行こう！
Let's go down!

669
00:52:58,080 --> 00:53:01,880
風鈴の音で ウトウトしながら
Dozing off to the sound of wind chimes,

670
00:53:01,880 --> 00:53:05,580
夢見ごこちで ヨダレをたらしてる
drooling in a dreamlike daze.

671
00:53:05,580 --> 00:53:10,080
Woh... いつもと同じ 網戸ごしの風の匂い
Woh... The same scent of wind through the screen door as always.

672
00:53:10,080 --> 00:53:15,580
休日でみんなも ゴロゴロしてるのに
Even though everyone is lazing around on their day off,

673
00:53:15,580 --> 00:53:19,080
君はずいぶん 忙しい顔をしてるネ
you've got such a busy look on your face.

674
00:53:19,080 --> 00:53:23,580
そうだいつかの あの場所へ行こう
That's right, let's go to that place from back then.

675
00:53:23,580 --> 00:53:28,080
真夏の夜の波の音は
The sound of midsummer night waves

676
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:32,080
不思議な程心 静かになる
calms the heart to a mysterious degree.

677
00:53:32,080 --> 00:53:36,080
少しだけ全て忘れて
Forgetting everything just for a moment,

678
00:53:36,080 --> 00:53:41,080
波の音の中 包みこまれていく
we get wrapped up in the sound of the waves.

679
00:53:41,080 --> 00:53:45,080
この細い細い うら道を抜けて
Passing through this narrow, narrow side alley,

680
00:53:45,080 --> 00:53:49,080
誰もいない大きな 夜の海見ながら
looking at the vast, deserted night sea,

681
00:53:49,080 --> 00:53:53,080
線香花火に 二人で
the two of us together

682
00:53:53,080 --> 00:54:00,080
ゆっくりゆっくり 火をつける
slowly, slowly light up sparklers.

683
00:54:00,080 --> 00:54:04,580
いつか君の涙が こぼれおちそうになったら
If your tears ever threaten to spill over someday,

684
00:54:04,580 --> 00:54:08,080
何もしてあげられないけど
though there's nothing I can really do for you,

685
00:54:08,080 --> 00:54:12,580
少しでもそばにいるよ...
I'll be by your side as much as I can...

686
00:54:12,580 --> 00:54:18,080
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Carrying you on the back of my bicycle down this long, long downhill slope,

687
00:54:18,080 --> 00:54:21,280
ブレーキいっぱい 握りしめて
squeezing the brakes as tight as I can,

688
00:54:21,280 --> 00:54:26,580
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
we slowly, slowly go down,

689
00:54:26,580 --> 00:54:31,580
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
slowly, slowly go down,

690
00:54:31,580 --> 00:54:38,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
slowly, slowly go down.

691
00:54:44,080 --> 00:54:47,080
夏だね！
It's summer!

692
00:54:47,080 --> 00:54:49,580
夏が始まった！
Summer has started!

693
00:54:55,580 --> 00:54:58,580
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

694
00:55:00,688 --> 00:55:01,888
にゃー
Meow!

695
00:55:01,888 --> 00:55:03,888
じゃあ、ちょっと連続なんですけど
Well, it's back-to-back songs, but...

696
00:55:03,888 --> 00:55:04,888
あら
Oh my.

697
00:55:04,888 --> 00:55:07,788
最後4人で歌いたいと思います！
We'd like to sing together with all four of us at the end!

698
00:55:07,788 --> 00:55:08,888
おー！
Yay!

699
00:55:08,888 --> 00:55:10,588
何歌うんですか？
What are you going to sing?

700
00:55:10,588 --> 00:55:12,688
何歌うんだろうね？
I wonder what we're singing?

701
00:55:12,688 --> 00:55:15,588
じゃあ皆さん聴いてください！おねがいします！
Everyone, please listen! Here we go!

702
00:55:15,588 --> 00:55:16,888
おねがいします！
Here we go!

703
00:55:16,888 --> 00:55:18,588
ウィーアー！
We Are!

704
00:55:19,088 --> 00:55:20,888
誰が言う？誰が言う？
Who says it? Who says it?

705
00:55:21,088 --> 00:55:23,088
冷静に！冷静に！
Calm down! Calm down!

706
