富、名声、力、この世のすべてを手に入れた男、海賊王ゴールド・ロジャー。
Wealth, fame, power... The man who acquired everything this world had to offer, the Pirate King, Gold Roger.

707
00:55:27,588 --> 00:55:32,088
彼の死に際に放った一言は、人々を海に駆り立てた。
His dying words drove people to the seas.

708
00:55:32,088 --> 00:55:37,088
「俺の財宝か？欲しけりゃくれたる！探せ！この世のすべてをそこに置いてきた！」
"My treasure? If you want it, you can have it! Find it! I left everything this world has to offer in that place!"

709
00:55:40,088 --> 00:55:43,888
男たちはグランドラインを目指し、夢を追い続ける。世はまさに、大海賊時代！
Men headed for the Grand Line, chasing their dreams. The world is truly in the Great Pirate Era!

710
