We are, We are on the cruise! ウィーアー！
We are, We are on the cruise! We Are!

723
00:57:05,088 --> 00:57:08,588
ウィーアー！
We Are!

724
00:57:42,588 --> 00:57:47,588
ぜんぶまに受けて 信じちゃっても
Even if you take everything to heart and believe it

725
00:57:47,588 --> 00:57:52,588
肩を押されて 1歩リードさ
Getting pushed on the shoulder gives you a one-step lead

726
00:57:52,588 --> 00:57:56,588
今度会えたなら 話すつもりさ
If we ever meet again, I plan to talk about

727
