We are, We are on the cruise! ウィーアー！
We are, We are on the cruise! We Are!

734
00:58:43,088 --> 00:58:49,088
ありったけの夢を かき集め
Gathering up all the pieces of our dreams

735
00:58:49,088 --> 00:58:55,588
捜し物を 探しに行くのさ
We're going to search for everything we're looking for

736
00:58:55,588 --> 00:59:08,088
ポケットのコイン それと You wanna be my Friend? / We are, We are on the cruise!
A coin in the pocket, and You wanna be my Friend? / We are, We are on the cruise!

737
00:59:08,088 --> 00:59:17,088
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We Are! We Are! We Are!

738
00:59:18,088 --> 00:59:20,088
イエーイ！
Yay!

739
00:59:20,088 --> 00:59:23,088
やばい、もう時間だ！最後に知らせがあります！
Oh no, time is almost up! We have an announcement at the end!

